## Investigation (read-only, live Supabase project inmkhvwdcuyhnxkgfvsb)

$ select p.proname, pg_get_function_identity_arguments(p.oid), pg_get_functiondef(p.oid)
    from pg_proc p join pg_namespace n on n.oid = p.pronamespace
   where n.nspname = 'public'
     and p.proname in ('get_my_permitted_roles','set_role_preference','check_role_permitted','current_tenant_id');
  → saved verbatim to outputs/live-function-defs-before.txt.
  Confirms: get_my_permitted_roles aggregates ONLY public.user_permitted_roles;
  set_role_preference's memberships fallback also requires
  validate_role_assignment(); check_role_permitted reads user_permitted_roles only.

$ select c.relkind from pg_class c join pg_namespace n on n.oid=c.relnamespace
   where n.nspname='public' and c.relname='user_permitted_roles';
  → 'r' (base table, not a view over memberships) — earlier in this session.

